```
`POST /v1/auth/device/code`

**[Exchange Device Code or Refresh Token](/api-client/sdk/auth/device/token)**

```typescript TypeScript
photon.auth.device.token(input: DeviceTokenInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<DeviceTokenOutput>
```
`POST /v1/auth/device/token`

</Tab>
