<Tab title="Rust">
**[Start Device Authorization](/api-client/sdk/auth/device/authorize)**

```rust Rust
client.device_authorize().await -> Result<ResponseValue<types::DeviceAuthorizeResponse>, Error<DeviceAuthorizeError>>
```
